ns, outfit, and identity from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> (appears throughout the video): attribute_transfer - transfer only the action sequence, timing, weight shifts, hand and leg trajectories, body orientation changes, and camera movement from <Video 1> to <Subject 1>.\n<Video 1> (motion and camera structure): partially_preserved - preserve motion timing, choreography, shot rhythm, and camera trajectory only; do not preserve its performer, costume, scene, props, lighting, or background.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a coherent cinematic performance clip. [Shot 1] <Subject 1> begins in the requested target environment, already holding the same opening body orientation and center of gravity as the performer in <Video 1>. During the first second, <Subject 1> initiates the same torso lead, shoulder direction, and first foot placement from <Video 1>. The movement then follows the same timing: weight transfers through the hips, the arms travel along the corresponding paths, and the head direction changes at the same beats. The camera follows the same framing scale, pan direction, tracking speed, and momentum as <Video 1>, but it observes only <Subject 1> in the new environment. Midway through the shot, preserve the action peak, balance recovery, and transition rhythm from <Video 1>. End on the same final pose family and camera settling behavior, while keeping <Subject 1>'s appearance completely consistent with <Picture 1>. Do not show any visual element, person, clothing, location, prop, or background from <Video 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nUse only the target scene's natural ambience and synchronized movement sounds. Do not reuse the audible identity of <Video 1> unless an audio reference is explicitly supplied.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A","{\n  \"type\": \"video\",\n  \"name\": \"【4Kmmd布料_泠鸢】大喜   一起来摆摆摆摆_P1_AI_4k30帧_1.mp4\",\n  \"path\": \"h3_refs/videos/【4Kmmd布料_泠鸢】大喜   一起来摆摆摆摆_P1_AI_4k30帧_1.mp4\",\n  \"originalName\": \"【4Kmmd布料_泠鸢】大喜   一起来摆摆摆摆_P1_AI